@Ehr.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5010
@TenantId = a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@PatientId = a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Health
GET {{Ehr.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Patients for the documentation screen
GET {{Ehr.Api_HostAddress}}/api/patients

### Visit history for one patient
GET {{Ehr.Api_HostAddress}}/api/patients/{{PatientId}}/visits
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
